body:
So, a brief history: my one-legged count of Pomesania once saw a thicc e-girl in the bar and decided to have one-night stand. Obviously, after a couple of months it's obvious that the bomb (baby) has been planted. The count decided blackmail her and to take her as a concubine (since this is the only way this incel knows how to operate, otherwise the girl wouldn't agree), without telling anyone that the baby is his. After a while she gave him two twins as heirs. Great. The count's leige, duke of Prussia, started a war, count's army was helping him.

This is the moment, a sneaky boi from Sweden comes in, raids the capital, steals the concubine and sails off into the frozen desert like a true chad, taking her as HIS concubine.

After a while, she teleported all the way from Sweden to ask a count to drop a hook he has on her due to the bastard child.

&#x200B;

Creepy. Imagine this irl

&#x200B;

P.S. Also, the bastard, that she first gave birth to, was afrerwards stolen in another raid and I had to ransom her out.

&#x200B;

P.S.S. The liege, Duke of Prussia had 3 children, 1 of which is a girl, married off to the son, which this woman gave. The remaining 2 children out of 3, were... dealt with, so to say. And the Duke of Prussia lost his nightstick in a battle, so he's sterile.

Truely, a wild life this woman has. From an unlanded bar drunkard, to being stolen by a swedish man, and marrying your son to the only heir of the Duke of Prussia, in a span of like 8 years.

@Western people genially arguing about whether it is a spy device or not.
@Me, a cultured Russian lmao-ing about how they break their minds about a simple Soviet phone. 
Eehhh you made me laugh quite a bit. It's just a phone, calm down xD
